Title: F1-M03 — The North Road (briefing)
Credit: Staalfront
Author: Staalfront narrative team
Draft date: 2026-10-17

FADE IN:

INT. FORWARD COMMAND POST - DAWN

[[AMBIENCE: radio hiss, distant engines, wind against canvas]]
[[MUSIC: restrained military tension]]

A map of the operational area is spread across a table. CAPTAIN ELIAN and MIRA stand over it.

LOGISTICS CHIEF RUSK
(serious)
The convoy carries fuel, field radios, and medical stores. Without it, the northern garrison has two days at most.

[[SHOT: map]]
[[MAP: operational area, player start, objective route, enemy approach]]

MIRA
(measured)
The valley road is exposed. If the trucks stop, the whole column becomes a target.

CAPTAIN ELIAN
(firm)
Escort the convoy to the garrison. If the main road is blocked, keep the vehicles together and take the forest route.

[[SFX: radio click]]
[[MUSIC: stop]]

FADE OUT.
